a, who has been despatched by Ravana, worthy of being slain. as","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.786,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-6-17-26"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"6011018","sanskritFile":"Ram06.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"36f9d4e551f81ec313d1addae69873ad8f2c1be72b0f8e12b91bac42759c50dc","compact":"b5b34cbb7d3dc4c3134bc84ead433f9cf693bee3d9f9fdacf173c0f84852ed1e","nasal":"b5b34cbb7d3dc4c3134bc84ead433f9cf693bee3d9f9fdacf173c0f84852ed1e"}},{"id":"VRCE-6-11-19","kanda":6,"kandaId":"yuddha","sarga":11,"verse":19,"english":"Being impelled by his wicked intention and commissioned by Rävaņa, this Rākşasa has come here and secretly by virtue of his illusive powers he shall slay you, O innocent one, when you shall place confidence in him.","alignment":{"type":"grouped","confidence":0.643,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-6-17-27"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"6011019","sanskritFile":"Ram06.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"0599a4d3572571af9fa8fc214f1446a2ba800322a974e669f28f08991cecfd53","compact":"d72635c440a38e006045f534998cbd750469ddfdefc1f705ba1c45f02a55e645","nasal":"beacb2ec2a4113c85c930aac77321a73bb17bb2f0cd130ccd28df0f43ef06acf"}},{"id":"VRCE-6-11-20","kanda":6,"kandaId":"yuddha","sarga":11,"verse":20,"english":"Being impelled by his wicked intention and commissioned by Rävaņa, this Rākşasa has come here and secretly by virtue of his illusive powers he shall slay you, O innocent one, when you shall place confidence in him.","alignment":{"type":"grouped","confidence":0.857,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-6-17-27"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"6011020","sanskritFile":"Ram06.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"250daf3133b22949bdf1a4bf68c1d40f6232300c8156020ed147af2bc13e8f77","compact":"e66ea202410